  "category": "environment",
  "status": "provisional",
  "comment": "THE SUNKEN ROOTS: the green-black dark under the forest — trunks as wide as halls, the great roots that arch over the way and the curtains that hang from the roof of the world. What makes the zone that zone: the three seamless strips of its backdrop, tall enough for the camera of every room of it; the ground its rooms are built of; the pieces that stand, lie and hang in them; and the light in its colour. Painted by the generator in tools/art (npm run art:build), not by a person: provisional until an artist reviews or replaces it.",
